          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Inside Our Robotic Welding Cell",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<h3>FANUC 120iC Robotic Welding Cell</h3><p>Our FANUC 120iC robotic welding cell is engineered for performance:</p><ul><li>74” reach arm provides extensive access to weld points across large or complex assemblies</li><li>Twin rotary tables (120” x 60” capacity) allow for part repositioning and dual-station loading, improving efficiency and weld access</li><li>Integrated with MIG welding for fast, strong welds</li><li>Programmed with custom paths to ensure every weld is consistent and on-spec</li></ul><p>This configuration is particularly valuable for repetitive jobs where accuracy and efficiency matter most.</p>",
