          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our Full-Service Fabrication & Machine Shop",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Robotic welding is just one part of our vertically integrated operation. At our facility in Malta, Ohio, EZG Manufacturing offers in-house fabrication, machining, forming, and finishing, all under one roof.</p><p>Capabilities include:</p><ul><li>CNC machining (lathe and milling for tight-tolerance parts)</li><li>Laser cutting (thick and thin materials, high precision)</li><li>Press brake forming (up to 1” steel plate)</li><li>Powder coating for a durable, finished product</li></ul><p>Our machine shop ensures a seamless handoff between fabrication and final production, saving you time, money, and headaches. Our team combines decades of fabrication experience with modern equipment and a commitment to quality. Whether you’re producing one component or thousands, EZG provides consistent weld quality throughout your project.</p>",
